WEBVTT

00:05.160 --> 00:09.640
Your Majesty the Ministry of War has complained several times saying they can no longer command.

00:09.720 --> 00:11.280
Zhu Yuanzhi's Beishuo Army.

00:12.160 --> 00:15.120
This army was originally formed from refugees.

00:19.800 --> 00:25.680
Most only recognize their commander only care about relationships since General Zhu took command.

00:25.960 --> 00:31.240
His orders in the Beishuo Army are more effective than imperial orders I believe.

00:31.320 --> 00:37.160
Your Majesty should curtail Zhu Yuanzhi's power as soon as possible since Chancellor Xie has come together.

00:37.840 --> 00:40.507
He must already have an idea in mind.

00:41.800 --> 00:47.280
In my view Your Majesty can summon General Zhu to the capital then give him a nominal position.

00:47.360 --> 00:50.027
Transfer Chu Meng to command the Beishuo Army.

00:51.800 --> 00:53.960
Your Majesty, be careful.

00:56.040 --> 01:01.280
First, Chu Meng is Chu Huan's son descendant of loyal martyrs this status is sufficient.

01:01.440 --> 01:04.920
Second, Chu Meng is rigorous humble and loyal.

01:05.000 --> 01:07.840
Perfect for rectifying the Beishuo Army's atmosphere.

